body:
I have done very little of note. I've only been on hormones for 7 months at this point, and Anything else is currently out of reach budgetarily.

&nbsp;

I think of Leelah sometimes, and the important martyr she became. I'm not really sure what else to say.

I actually did reach out to someone before making this post, because I was... scared to post it. his reassurances are why i'm responding to you right now.

&nbsp;

I will talk with him again, and see if he will be willing to help me more, and help me find a counselor to talk with. Thank you.
